{"title":"Install on Kubernetes","description":"Install Stirling PDF on Kubernetes with the official Helm chart, keep its data on a persistent volume and upgrade it.","unlisted":false,"space":"server","layout":"","article":"<a class=\"doc-space\" data-accent=\"server\" href=\"/Server/\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 6.5h.01M7 17.5h.01\"/></svg><span>Self-hosted server</span></a>\n    <h1>Install on Kubernetes</h1>\n<p>Install Stirling PDF with the official Helm chart:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">helm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://stirling-tools.github.io/Stirling-PDF-chart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">helm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> update</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">helm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf/stirling-pdf-chart</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --create-namespace</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> values.yaml</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"valuesyaml\" class=\"anchor-heading\">values.yaml<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#valuesyaml\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>Put your overrides in <code>values.yaml</code>. The chart's <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF-chart/blob/main/charts/stirling-pdf/values.yaml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">default values.yaml</a> lists every option with comments.</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">yaml</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3.1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # the chart's default image is an older release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">persistence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">deployment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  extraVolumeMounts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">storage-volume</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # the volume the chart creates when persistence is enabled</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      mountPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/configs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      subPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">configs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">storage-volume</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      mountPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/storage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      subPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">storage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">envs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SYSTEM_DEFAULTLOCALE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">en-GB</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>image.tag:</strong> a version tag pins the release, so you choose when to upgrade. For the fat or ultra-lite image, see <a href=\"/Server/Install/Docker/#choose-an-image\">Choose an image</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Persistence:</strong> Stirling PDF keeps users, <code>settings.yml</code> and its built-in database in <code>/configs</code>, and files users save on the server in <code>/storage</code>. Without a persistent volume they are lost when the pod restarts. Enabling persistence creates the volume, and <code>extraVolumeMounts</code> mounts a folder of it at each path.</li>\n<li><strong>envs:</strong> any setting can be passed as an environment variable. See <a href=\"/Server/Configuration/\">Configuration</a> for the naming rule.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Give the pod at least 4 GB of memory with <code>resources.limits.memory</code> (see <a href=\"/Server/Operations/Performance/#sizing\">Sizing</a>). For a sub-path, set the chart's <code>rootPath</code> option rather than <code>SYSTEM_ROOTURIPATH</code>, so the health checks use it too.</p>\n<h2 id=\"upgrade\" class=\"anchor-heading\">Upgrade<a class=\"anchor-link\" href=\"#upgrade\" aria-label=\"Direct link\">#</a></h2><p>Change <code>image.tag</code> in <code>values.yaml</code> to the new version, then run:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">helm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> update</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">helm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upgrade</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf/stirling-pdf-chart</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> values.yaml</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>If you use <code>latest</code>, the tag never changes, so <code>helm upgrade</code> does not restart the pod or pull the new image. Set <code>image.pullPolicy: Always</code> in <code>values.yaml</code> and apply it with the command above. After that, restart the pod to upgrade:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><button class=\"codeblock-copy\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg></button><span class=\"codeblock-lang\">bash</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> restart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/stirling-pdf-stirling-pdf-chart</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --namespace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stirling-pdf</span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p>To run several replicas behind one service, see <a href=\"/Server/Operations/Clustering/\">Clustering</a>.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-source\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-Tools.github.io/edit/main/docs/Server/Install/Kubernetes.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z\"/></svg>\n        Edit this page on GitHub\n      </a>\n    </div>","toc":"<div class=\"toc-title\">On this page</div><ul><li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#valuesyaml\">values.yaml</a></li>\n<li class=\"toc-l2\"><a href=\"#upgrade\">Upgrade</a></li></ul>","pager":"<a class=\"pager-link pager-prev\" href=\"/Server/Install/Docker/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">&larr; Previous</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Docker</span>\n      </a><a class=\"pager-link pager-next\" href=\"/Server/Install/JAR/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">Next &rarr;</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Bare bones (JAR)</span>\n      </a>"}